{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_prove_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_prove_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"同事們","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_prove_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"50ef725132481423847b6963d8781d0bd61a73cdfb529ce5e00d357de8ac387d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"01:35 P.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦，第三艙室，醫療護理室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"來，轉身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"請就這樣先不要動，不可以，尾巴也不可以動啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"61.3......嗯，尾巴又長了一些呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好，這樣就可以了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"已經檢查完啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，剛剛真的好癢。說真的，每次這樣量尾巴都很不習慣，實在很難克制得住不動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"普羅旺斯小姐的反應還算好了，只是會動一動而已，還有幹員甚至直接就會擺出攻擊動作，那才叫難處理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，畢竟總有些地方會比較敏感嘛，聽說完全不能被碰觸的種族也是有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，時間到了，給，對著這個吹一口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛的血液檢測需要到後天才會出結果，初步的診斷報告一會就可以拿到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"來，這是溶解劑，把這個喝掉就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啊，每次都勞你們費心，剛回來就要做這麼多項檢查，真是辛苦你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"自己的身體自己清楚，其實我真的沒什麼問題啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"普羅旺斯小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，在，在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再說這樣的話了，你看看這次回來之後的檢查資料，各項指標都有些浮動了不是嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這次也比預計時間要多在外面停留了一陣子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間羅德島已經深入荒原，這附近幾乎沒有已知的移動城市航道，誰也說不清周邊有多少危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不做好防護，在這種荒地裡停留太久是非常危險的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"是我不好啦。拜託拜託，別和我生氣，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我們線路附近有幾個小型村莊，我實在有點放心不下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"就算普羅旺斯小姐是專業的天災信使，也要注意自己的安危啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我保證！我保證很安全的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我已經按照上次說好的那樣，把全身都包起來啦，放心，我不會拿自己的身體開玩笑的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別瞎操心了，她們天災信使有的是辦法保證自己的安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是像這種，不隸屬於任何城邦，完全獨立在野外行走的信使......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說我就沒見過幾個天災信使能逃得過礦石病的，但要是換個普通人丟進他們那環境裡，估計早就該病死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人倒是一個兩個都還活蹦亂跳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這話我能當做是誇獎嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，我沒聽清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你說的也沒錯啦，我們那樣的工作環境，確實不是普通人能適應得了的。但是呢，只要能完成前期學習，要規避風險就也沒有那麼困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"像我的很多同行，其實都只為某一個城邦服務，或者受雇於一些大型公司，那樣就沒什麼太大危險，還能拿到豐厚的酬勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"天災信使畢竟也屬於門檻很高的高薪職業呢，考核可是非常嚴格的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，最近才剛剛來了兩位新幹員，好像都是透過天災信使的平台經紀人介紹過來的，也是普羅旺斯小姐的同行吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你說的是萊恩哈特和月禾吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩位可都還挺有名的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我來檢查之前才見過他們倆，萊恩哈特看起來適應得很不錯，真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你和那個長耳朵臭小子認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊這個小傢伙當初可都被那小子鬧哭了，你自己問她，是不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"華法琳醫生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我不說了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"你也笑得太誇張了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，正好，那小子和那位東國的御子該接受的檢查還沒做完，你們既然是熟人，就幫忙把他們喊過來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，行，沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先走啦~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"大嬸，我吃完了，盤子就放在這裡了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"瘦了？怎麼會，我這個年紀大家都這樣啦，大概是因為還在長高才會看起來有點瘦吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，我有好好在吃飯，這不是都到食堂來吃大嬸做的飯菜嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的炒米糕很好吃！昨天的蛋捲也超棒的！啊，先不說了，那大嬸，接下來還有訓練，我就先走啦~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的人怎麼比我想的還要熱情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，再這麼吃下去，我遲早會發胖的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有什麼不好嘛，食堂的大嬸看起來真的很喜歡你呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，萊恩哈特，看來你過得不錯，真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜這個時間你大概是在食堂，幸好你還沒走遠，我正在找你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，普羅旺斯小姐。你就別開我的玩笑了，來這裡之後，我真的都胖了不少，衣服都該重新買了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"普羅旺斯小姐找我是有什麼事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"華法琳醫生找你去做後續的檢查。嗯，也不光是你，還有月禾小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛我去舞蹈室看過，那裡沒人在，也不知道月禾小姐會在哪裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，月禾小姐的話我知道哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"除了跳舞和做神事，月禾小姐還很喜歡找個安靜地方看風景，我之前才剛在外層附近遇到過她，現在應該還在那裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......明明你也才來沒多久，這些事情倒是知道得很清楚嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，平常大家的喜好，我都有在關注哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"漸積雲層，起微風，濃霧盡散......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"......看起來，不像是一個好天氣呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，太好了，月禾小姐還在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"哈囉~月禾小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，月禾小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀哎呀，兩位，下午好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了兩位，跑得這樣急，是找我有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是的，華法琳醫生讓我通知月禾小姐去醫療部，進行後續的身體檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣。那麼，我現在就過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，也沒有這麼急！現在這個時間的話，估計那邊的醫療幹員也去午休啦，稍微等一等再過去也來得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！醫療部的小姐姐也是需要休息時間的啦，我們也趁機放鬆放鬆嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾小姐吃過飯了沒有？羅德島的食堂真的很不錯哦，炒米糕和北薩德萊燉菜都非常推薦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，我已經用過飯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然是受您推薦的菜品，之後我可要好好品嘗一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對不會讓月禾小姐失望的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......這裡的風景真的很不錯呢，之前我都沒有注意過這裡，原來艦上還有這種地方啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是東國有名的災巡，月禾小姐果然很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"過獎，只是找一處清淨地方罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"與大家一起舞蹈，自然也有十分樂趣，但是像這樣安靜地看看風景，也很不錯哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"本身，我們這樣的天災信使在停留艦船上的時候，就有為主家提供環境監測的職責在身，如此，也不算是懈怠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"真敬業呢。果然我還是要多向各位前輩學習才行啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們的工作嘛，哎呀，在艦船上的時候總是不自覺地就鬆懈了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼回事，天氣好像變了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（雲層上怎麼會透出這樣的顏色......早上回來的時候明明還是正常的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有風痕......風並不猛烈，但是切痕卻這麼明顯......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾小姐，那邊的天空，你看那片雲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這個天象，這個特徵，是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"熾烈而不顯，霧水蒸散，要起驟風了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"方才我還不能完全確定，現在看來，確實是不巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"風向變了——是區域型突發天災！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"......我出去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！應該很快就要起大風了，現在出去的話可能會被吹掉下去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"放心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"——就這點小風，還不能把我怎麼樣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀......真是有活力的年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"看遠處深色的雲層，現在已經開始擴散了，空氣中的水氣，還有風的變化......嗯，我不會認錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是災厄氣象的前兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"真不走運，這種突發性的天災都能撞上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"等萊恩哈特回來，得趕快通知駕駛室的人和阿米婭他們才行！多虧發現得早，現在轉向的話，時間還很充足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，這附近好像沒有什麼需要通知的移動城邦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"像這樣氣候異常的地帶，大多不會有移動城市停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，如果撞上現在這樣發展急速的突發情況，大型的移動城邦可沒辦法及時撤離。城裡的大人物可不會冒這樣的風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島這樣靈活的設施，倒是沒什麼關係，總歸是能躲得開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，等一下......不對，不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近......那個方向，我記得那邊還有幾個村落！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀......真是如此？在這樣的土地上，竟還有人居住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"荒地裡其實有不少小聚落，各個國家都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"正經的移動城市他們進不去，城市周邊適合耕種的土地也大多早就被圈好了，只能挑偏遠一些的地方走一步看一步地過日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有辦法，大家早就習慣了隨時遷移，所有家當都能拆了帶走，反正整個村子也沒有多少人，稍微提前那麼一些，就還能跑得掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這麼一說，在東國時，確也聽說過這樣的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......這種事果然是在哪裡都有。不過就算習慣了，也總有來不及的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，每次我都會儘量多繞點路，去通知這些村落......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（也不知道村民們發現了天氣變化沒有。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"（萬一......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"久等了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看了一圈，不太妙啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"雲層異變的速度有點快，風向也變了，估計用不了多久這裡就不安全了，幾個小時，最多半天時間吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然這麼快？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"按照這個速度，接下來周邊都會生出異常氣象，不可再像剛剛那樣隨意就到艦外，太過冒險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我知道的。剛剛稍微往災雲的方向走了一小段路看了看，至少沒有城市存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前走就算是準備充足也可能會有危險，更詳細的情況暫時沒法確認了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊恩哈特","speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，其他的一會再說，那我先去通知阿米婭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我們也去做些準備吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我還是得去那邊的村落走一趟！不然我怎麼都不能安心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾小姐，艦內的準備就麻煩你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，稍待！普羅旺斯小姐，我剛說過，這太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"在天災形成速度不明確的情況下，深入那片區域的話，就連普羅旺斯小姐你自身也會陷入危險之中！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我會儘量小心的，總得要有人去通知他們啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大的移動城邦，會有他們自己的天災信使，或許沒有我去通知也不會有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這些小型的村莊和聚落不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們不去，這些村莊裡的人很有可能將會毫無防備地暴露在天災之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"像是這次這樣的突發性天災，等到他們發現情況不對，很有可能就已經太遲了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"月禾小姐，我們的工作難道不就是提前預警，竭力減少天災帶來的風險嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然大多人都說，成為天災信使，就能有高薪和安穩生活，但我認為不是這樣的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有忘記過我的初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"“一切都是為了更多的生命”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......或許每一個天災信使，對於這句話，都會有自己的理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"但是對於我來說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"對於我來說，住在城裡的大老爺，和小小村莊裡的農夫，生命的重量是一樣的。生命之間沒有區別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，好吧，我明白普羅旺斯小姐的想法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"平等的生命，確實是這樣，貧窮或是富貴，身份的高低貴賤並不影響我們生命的價值......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"這是很好的想法呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"那......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"普羅旺斯小姐自己的生命呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，在這些平等的生命裡，也有普羅旺斯小姐的一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"難道就讓我看著普羅旺斯小姐，為了救下更多人，將自己置於險境中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們能夠用數量來計算生命，為了挽救大多數，就毫無負擔地犧牲少數嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不會這樣說。如果一件事情想要做成，註定有人需要犧牲。那這件事就一定有哪裡出錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在並不是那樣的情況！也不是討論這個問題的時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我已經知道有人可能在我的眼前面臨天災的威脅，那我就一定得去。這是我的職責！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不會攔著普羅旺斯小姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"在瞭解到您的想法之後，再行阻攔就太說不過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我不會阻攔。我會和普羅旺斯小姐一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，普羅旺斯小姐難道忘了，你我可是同行呀。我要一同去，也是理所當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......真的會很危險的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚。所以，我要提出一個要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我判斷非常危險，那麼，就算使用強制手段，也會制止普羅旺斯小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是希望，普羅旺斯小姐可以更加重視自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。就這麼辦吧，月禾小姐，我們立刻出發！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"該怎麼說呢......月禾小姐，和我想像得有些不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我本來以為東國的御子，會更......嗯，更精英派一點，更不好接近一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，這完全是誤解呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月禾","speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是一直有努力在和羅德島的各位更親近的，最近也和各位漸入佳境了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"漸入佳境......聽起來怎麼怪怪的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，總之，行動吧！再不動身就真的要來不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這次回來之後，絕對又要被醫療部的那個妹妹罵了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，還是先想好該怎麼道歉吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_171_bldsk","aliases":["華法琳"]},{"speakerId":"char_343_tsukinogi","aliases":["月禾"]},{"speakerId":"char_373_Leonhardt","aliases":["萊恩哈特"]}]}
